Package: fp5-qtee
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, polkitd, systemd
Recommends: droid-juicer
Description: Fairphone 5 fingerprint unlock through the Qualcomm TEE
 Loads the FocalTech trustlet through the upstream qcomtee driver and
 matches fingerprints for the Phosh lock screen. A socket-activated system
 service runs the session; polkit decides who may use it (no sudo).
 Needs a kernel with CONFIG_QCOMTEE and the focaltech-fp driver.
